1 0 0 1 50 232 Tm
(lim\(x->c\) g\(x\) = lim\(x->c\) h\(x\) = L,) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 216 Tm
(then lim\(x->c\) f\(x\) = L.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 200 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 184 Tm
